.* QUISYSVAL: DSPSYSVAL (one system value) and WRKSYSVAL (the list).
:PNLGRP.
:COPYR.(C) COPYRIGHT QUARTZ SYSTEMS 2026.
:CLASS NAME=NAMECL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=TEXTCL BASETYPE='CHAR 51'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=LBLCL BASETYPE='CHAR 30'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=OPTCL BASETYPE=ACTION.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=TYPECL BASETYPE='CHAR 7'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=LTEXTCL BASETYPE='CHAR 50'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=SVNAME CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=SVTEXT CLASS=TEXTCL.
:VAR NAME=SVTEXT2 CLASS=TEXTCL.
:VAR NAME=SVLABEL CLASS=LBLCL VALUE='Value'.
:VAR NAME=SVVAL1 CLASS=TEXTCL.
:VAR NAME=SVVAL2 CLASS=TEXTCL.
:VAR NAME=SVVAL3 CLASS=TEXTCL.
:VAR NAME=SVVAL4 CLASS=TEXTCL.
:VAR NAME=OPT CLASS=OPTCL.
:VAR NAME=SVGROUP CLASS=TYPECL.
:VAR NAME=SVDESC CLASS=LTEXTCL.
:VAR NAME=SUBSET CLASS=NAMECL VALUE='*ALL'.
:VAR NAME=POSTO CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=POSHINT CLASS=LTEXTCL VALUE='Starting characters of system value'.
:VAR NAME=SUBHINT CLASS=LTEXTCL VALUE='F4 for list'.
:LISTDEF NAME=SYSVALS VARS='OPT SVNAME SVGROUP SVDESC'.
:KEYL NAME=DSPKEYS HELP='KEYS/DSPKEYS'.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F1 ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:EKEYL.
:KEYL NAME=WRKKEYS HELP='KEYS/WRKKEYS'.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F1 ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F4 ACTION='RETURN 4'.F4=Prompt
:KEYI KEY=F5 ACTION='RETURN 5'.F5=Refresh
:KEYI KEY=F9 ACTION=RETRIEVE.F9=Retrieve
:KEYI KEY=F11 ACTION='RETURN 11'.F11=Display names only
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:KEYI KEY=PAGEUP ACTION=PAGEUP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEDOWN ACTION=PAGEDOWN.
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=DSPSYSVAL HELP=HLPDSP KEYL=DSPKEYS.Display System Value
:DATA DEPTH='*'.
:DATAI VAR=SVNAME USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/SVNAME'.System value
:DATAI VAR=SVTEXT USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/SVTEXT'.Description
:DATAI VAR=SVTEXT2 USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/SVTEXT2'.
:DATAC.
:DATAC.
:DATAI VAR=SVVAL1 USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/SVVAL1'.&SVLABEL.
:DATAI VAR=SVVAL2 USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/SVVAL2'.
:DATAI VAR=SVVAL3 USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/SVVAL3'.
:DATAI VAR=SVVAL4 USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/SVVAL4'.
:EDATA.
:BOTINST.Press Enter to continue.
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=WRKSYSVAL HELP=HLPWRK KEYL=WRKKEYS TOPSEP=SYSNAM.Work with System Values
:DATA DEPTH=3.
:DATACOL WIDTH=24.
:DATACOL WIDTH=78.
:DATAI VAR=POSTO USAGE=INPUT HELP='FLD/POSTO'.Position to
:DATAIX VAR=POSHINT USAGE=OUTPUT.
:DATAI VAR=SUBSET USAGE=INPUT HELP='FLD/SUBSET'.Subset by Type
:DATAIX VAR=SUBHINT USAGE=OUTPUT.
:EDATA.
:TOPINST.Type options, press Enter.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=SYSVALS SCROLL=YES.
:LISTACT OPTION=2 ENTER='CMD ?CHGSYSVAL SYSVAL(&SVNAME.)' HELP='WRKSYSVAL/OPTIONS'.2=Change
:LISTACT OPTION=5 ENTER='CMD DSPSYSVAL SYSVAL(&SVNAME.)' HELP='WRKSYSVAL/OPTIONS'.5=Display
:LISTCOL VAR=OPT USAGE=INPUT HELP='WRKSYSVAL/OPT'.Option
:LISTCOL VAR=SVNAME USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/SVNAME'.System Value
:LISTCOL VAR=SVGROUP USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/SVGROUP'.Type
:LISTCOL VAR=SVDESC USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/SVDESC'.Description
:ELIST.
:CMDLINE SIZE=SHORT.Command
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=HLPDSP.Display System Value - Help
:P.This display shows one system value: its name, what it controls
and the value the system holds for it now.
:P.Press Enter, F3 or F12 to leave. To change the value, use the
CHGSYSVAL command or option 2 of WRKSYSVAL.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=HLPWRK.Work with System Values - Help
:P.This display lists the system values, with the group each one
belongs to and a line about it.
:P.Type 2 next to a value to change it, or 5 to look at it, and press
Enter. F5 reads the values again.
:EHELP.
.* Item, key and option help.
:HELP NAME='KEYS/DSPKEYS'.Function keys
:PARML.
:PT.F3=Exit
:PD.Ends the display and returns to where it was started from.
:PT.F12=Cancel
:PD.Returns to the previous display without acting on what was typed.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/SVNAME'.System value
:P.The system value.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/SVTEXT'.Description
:P.The description shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/SVTEXT2'.SVTEXT2
:P.The SVTEXT2 shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/SVVAL1'.&amp.SVLABEL
:P.The &amp.SVLABEL shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/SVVAL2'.SVVAL2
:P.The SVVAL2 shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/SVVAL3'.SVVAL3
:P.The SVVAL3 shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/SVVAL4'.SVVAL4
:P.The SVVAL4 shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='KEYS/WRKKEYS'.Function keys
:PARML.
:PT.F3=Exit
:PD.Ends the display and returns to where it was started from.
:PT.F4=Prompt
:PD.Prompts the command on the command line, or the command of the
option typed.
:PT.F5=Refresh
:PD.Shows the display again with the current information.
:PT.F9=Retrieve
:PD.Puts the last command run back on the command line; press it again
for the one before.
:PT.F11=Display names only
:PD.Shows the list with the names alone, so more fit on a page.
:PT.F12=Cancel
:PD.Returns to the previous display without acting on what was typed.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/POSTO'.Position to
:P.Type the position to.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/SUBSET'.Subset by Type
:P.Type the subset by Type.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='WRKSYSVAL/OPT'.Option
:P.Type the number of an option next to an entry and press Enter. The
options the list allows are shown above it; F1 on one of them explains
it.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/SVGROUP'.Type
:P.The type of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/SVDESC'.Description
:P.The description of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='WRKSYSVAL/OPTIONS'.Options
:P.Type an option number next to one or more entries and press Enter.
The option runs for each entry it is typed next to, in order.
:PARML.
:PT.2=Change
:PD.Type 2 next to an entry and press Enter to change it. The Change
System Value (CHGSYSVAL) command is prompted for the entry.
:PT.5=Display
:PD.Type 5 next to an entry and press Enter to display it. The Display
System Value (DSPSYSVAL) command runs for the entry.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
